                           [--overwrite]

Stage 2B: Run existing Stage 2/3 attack prompts through Qwen3-14B reasoning
model locally. Captures all tokens (input, thinking, output) without trimming.
Scores each output with StrongREJECT and an LLM judge (Gemini).

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --input-jsonl INPUT_JSONL
                        Path to Stage 2 or Stage 3 JSONL artifact.
  --output-jsonl OUTPUT_JSONL
                        Output JSONL path (one row per input example).
  --summary-json SUMMARY_JSON
                        Output summary JSON path.
  --model-name-or-path MODEL_NAME_OR_PATH
  --max-new-tokens MAX_NEW_TOKENS
                        Maximum generated tokens. Default 32768 — do not trim
                        thinking tokens.
  --enable-thinking     Enable Qwen3 thinking/reasoning mode (default: true).
  --no-thinking
  --do-sample
  --seed SEED
  --max-examples MAX_EXAMPLES
                        Process at most this many input rows (for smoke
                        tests).
  --skip-judge          Skip the Gemini LLM judge step (StrongREJECT only).
  --skip-strongreject   Skip StrongREJECT scoring (judge only).
  --resume              Skip already-processed example_ids in output JSONL.
  --overwrite           Overwrite output files if they already exist.

